# Arch Linux ARM. Antharchy runs no mirror of its own, so all three channels
# share one base mirrorlist; the channel lives in the [antharchy] Server line
# in pacman.conf, not here.
#
# NOTE: Arch Linux ARM publishes no archive service, so unlike upstream's
# frozen stable-mirror there is no way to pin ARM's base to a snapshot. ARM
# stable is built against a moving base. See docs/architecture.md.
Server = http://mirror.archlinuxarm.org/$arch/$repo
